{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","permalink_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/FFmpeg:8f3cccb...FFmpeg:39e1969","diff_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDhmM2NjY2JjYTRhNWYxZjgxYWI3Yjk5MGNlMWFjYzRjYjdiOTFhYmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Romain Beauxis","email":"romain.beauxis@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-21T15:24:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"James Almer","email":"jamrial@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-21T23:30:36Z"},"message":"avcodec/opus/parser: report the duration in units of the sample rate\n\nThe parser duration is documented in units of AVCodecContext.sample_rate,\nbut the Opus parser reported it at 48 kHz whatever the rate. A demuxer\ndeclaring another rate then gave packets a wrong duration.","tree":{"sha":"3b3506c0d9fdbd8cc4ff0fb34068b5beadf4573e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/3b3506c0d9fdbd8cc4ff0fb34068b5beadf4573e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/8f3cccbca4a5f1f81ab7b990ce1acc4cb7b91abc/comments","author":{"login":"toots","id":871060,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTA2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/871060?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots","html_url":"https://github.com/toots","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toots/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"jamrial","id":2442845,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDI4NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2442845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial","html_url":"https://github.com/jamrial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamrial/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/24c2676ea52dfcb755b04960ca3a9de1bee24d6b"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDM5ZTE5NjkzMDNhMGI5ZWM1ZmI1ZjVlYjY0M2JmN2E1YjY5YzBhODk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nicholas Carlini","email":"nicholas@carlini.com","date":"2026-03-14T04:47:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"michaelni","email":"michael@niedermayer.cc","date":"2026-03-14T16:52:58Z"},"message":"avcodec/h264_slice: reject slice_num >= 0xFFFF\n\nAn H.264 picture with 65536 slices makes slice_num collide with the\nslice_table sentinel. slice_table is uint16_t, initialized via\nmemset(..., -1, ...) so spare entries (one per row, mb_stride =\nmb_width + 1) stay 0xFFFF. slice_num is an uncapped ++h->current_slice.\nAt slice 65535 the collision makes slice_table[spare] == slice_num\npass, defeating the deblock_topleft check in xchg_mb_border and the\ntop_type zeroing in fill_decode_caches.\n\nWith both guards bypassed at mb_x = 0, top_borders[top_idx][-1]\nunderflows 96 bytes and XCHG writes at -88 below the allocation\n(plus -72 and -56 for chroma in the non-444 path).\n\nFixes: heap-buffer-overflow\n\nFound-by: Nicholas Carlini <nicholas@carlini.com>\nSigned-off-by: Michael Niedermayer <michael@niedermayer.cc>","tree":{"sha":"3c4d8d4365b40c78d09d04dc1c99d27adf25cc72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/3c4d8d4365b40c78d09d04dc1c99d27adf25cc72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/39e1969303a0b9ec5fb5f5eb643bf7a5b69c0a89/comments","author":{"login":"carlini","id":1269300,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjkzMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269300?v=4","gravat